  "method": "One reviewer read condition-, bank-, solver seed- and grade-masked dialogue and executed tool names/arguments. Questions include specific requests for facts, decisions or confirmation and concrete opt-in offers; general offers to help are excluded. The index records an assistant turn, possibly containing several questions. Approval requires explicit assent to the actual business action after a proposal and before the first executed mutation. A customer may supply a corrected payment method while authorizing the action. Merely selecting a method or changing a passenger list does not by itself authorize booking. Denials require customer-facing text specific to the criterion; statements only in handoff arguments are excluded. The first communicated transfer refusal in task 6 is additionally coded to distinguish whether an agent could already have heard it. A missing turn is coded null.",
